Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 22:27:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(crm): Common canonical permission registry + expand
 Cor.CRM PerAuth pilot

Promote the seeded permission key list into Common.PermissionRegistry so Auth
and every microservice share identical ph bit indices without a runtime Auth
HTTP dependency. Auth initializes from CanonicalKeys and only logs DB drift;
Cor.CRM switches from /Registry fetch to InitializeFromCanonical().

Extend the CRM enforcement pilot from Routing/Scoring to LeadController
(crm.leads.list/conversion/bulk/assigned/routing keys). Document Postman
200/403 checks for the pilot.
